{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo:<br>This demo version Includes: <br>--First playable campaign area- Toffee Town.<br>--First quest. (includes a Boss fight)<br>--3 Party game modes. (currently supports 2 players)<br>--Upto 2 players in campaign mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>FULL VERSION:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Sugar Sling Showdown, a vibrant Candyland adventure, players wield their tongues to build, grapple, fling, and duel in a playful candy chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Unique Tongue Mechanics: Grapple, fling, and interact with the environment and enemies using innovative and chaotic tongue-powered gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690340/extras/TongueSSS.gif?t=1747198747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Nurture and Build: Nurturing rescued babies that'd determine the well being and development of Toffee Town adds a distinct flavor to a simplified colony sim.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690340/extras/NurtureSSS.gif?t=1747198747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Co-op mode: Work on Toffee Town together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690340/extras/ActionSSS.gif?t=1747198747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Party game modes: Challenge your friends to different pvp, pve game modes and assert dominance in the candy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690340/extras/Party.gif?t=1747198747\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Sweet fantasy: A distinct flavor of candy and veggie built world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690340/extras/ColonySim.gif?t=1747198747\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690340?t=1747198747","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690340?t=1747198747","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690340/94bfc9830ad9079cfa1e51c64e9280ed9e54f7e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747198747","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690340/94bfc9830ad9079cfa1e51c64e9280ed9e54f7e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747198747","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Demo:<br>This demo version Includes: <br>--First playable campaign area- Toffee Town.<br>--First quest. (includes a Boss fight)<br>--3 Party game modes. (currently supports 2 players)<br>--Upto 2 players in campaign mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>FULL VERSION:</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Gameplay:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Sugar Sling Showdown, a vibrant Candyland adventure, players wield their tongues to build, grapple, fling, and duel in a playful candy chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Unique Tongue Mechanics: Grapple, fling, and interact with the environment and enemies using innovative and chaotic tongue-powered gameplay.</p><p c